[I] Decoding library for the GIF image file format

[T] LibNSGIF is the NetSurf C library for decoding GIF format images and
[T] animations, licensed under the MIT licence. It scans GIF data
[T] incrementally before decoding and only fully decodes one frame at a
[T] time, reducing memory usage for large GIFs.

[U] https://download.netsurf-browser.org

[A] Netsurf
